              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, throwing spear, javelin, light armour and shield. May exchange throwing spear for thrusting spear (free). May be mounted on a horse (+8 pts). Warband. One figure, other than one designated Army General, may exchange its shield for the Army Battle Standard (+15 pts). A Welsh army with no Teyrn may be led by an Uchelwyr. (Shieldwall p.52)</characteristic>
