              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Sword. May be armed with light armour (+3 pts) and shield (+2 pts). May only accompany Teulu, Priodaur and Bonnedig. Warband. You may re-roll rally attempts of any unit the Priest is accompanying. 0-1. (Shieldwall p.53)</characteristic>
