  <sharedRules>
    <rule id="9ff1-0192-b83e-7872" name="Welsh (Shieldwall) - List Notes" publicationId="af20-e256-4a51-93aa" hidden="false">
      <description>WELSH ARMY LISTS (Shieldwall, pp.49-56): Gwynedd, Powys, the Southern Kingdoms and Dumnonia. Percentages are by points. Special rules p.52 (Choice of Terrain: if players agree to randomly choose the terrain, the Welsh player may always select one additional item of terrain which he may place anywhere other than the opponent's deployment zone).
The Teulu and the Priodaur/Bonnedig/Taeog pools are as printed: the Teulu is not part of the Common or Uncommon percentages.

ARMY COMPOSITIONS (pick one in the Army composition list):
[Gwynedd]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 50%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 25%
  Gwynedd (p.51). Characters up to 33%; Priodaur and Bonnedig at least 50%; Taeog and Dogs of War (Vikings, Freebooters) up to 25%. Teulu and Priodaur may exchange throwing spear for thrusting spears (free).
[Powys]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 50%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 25%
  Powys (pp.51-52). Characters up to 33%; the army may not include any Teyrn. Priodaur and Bonnedig at least 50%; Taeog and Dogs of War (Vikings, Freebooters) up to 25%. Every other unit of Priodaur may exchange shield and spear for bow (free).
[Southern Kingdoms]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 50%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 25%
  The Southern Kingdoms (p.52). Characters up to 33%; Priodaur and Bonnedig at least 50%; Taeog and Dogs of War (Vikings, Amsaigh) up to 25%. Priodaur may exchange their spear and shields for bows (free); the Teulu may have bows (+3 pts); at least half of the units of Priodaur must be bow-armed.
[Dumnonia]
  Characters: up to 33%
  Common Warriors: at least 50%
  Uncommon Warriors: up to 25%
  Dumnonia (p.52). Characters up to 33%; the army may not include the Teyrn. Priodaur and Bonnedig at least 50%; Taeog and Dogs of War (Vikings, Devroet) up to 25%. One unit armed with javelins may have poisoned javelins at an additional cost of +2 pts per model (counts as S4, armour saves not modified).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
</catalogue>
